<section id="where" aria-labelledby="h-where">
  <h2 id="h-where" class="sec">Where we can win</h2>
  <p class="sub">PlayWorld scores four task families. Genie 3 is strong on geometry and control but weak once something leaves the frame or has to change over time. Those two families are where inference-time memory and state tracking should pay off, so most of our work targets them. Bars start at 1, the score floor. "Ours" is one run, the same one as on the ruler above, never a per-family best-of-many; it is hatched while that run covers only part of the benchmark.</p>
